# Scenario 3, test design 15: the sum loses its carry (Hacker's Delight 2-5); wrong first at a = 0x01, b = 0xFF.
rule: average-overflowing
inputs: a: u<w>, b: u<w>
before: %x = Xor.u<w> %a, %b; %h = LShr.u<w>[strict] %x, 1; %c = And.u<w> %a, %b; %r = Add.u<w> %c, %h
after: %s = Add.u<w> %a, %b; %r = LShr.u<w>[strict] %s, 1
